<section class="py-8">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
    <p>We live in a world in transition. Old systems are losing their self-evidence, while new possibilities are emerging. Not yet as a clearly defined alternative, but as space to discover, to create, and to do things differently.</p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-center">The Playground is an open space to shape the future through play.</h2>

    <p class="mt-6">A place where curiosity leads to discovery, ideas invite creation, and encounters make new connections possible. Where you can move freely, experiment, and contribute from whatever sets you in motion.</p>

    <p>We believe that the new doesn't emerge by planning or controlling everything in advance. It grows when people are given the space to follow their own intentions, inspire each other, and explore possibilities together.</p>

    <p>That's why the Playground brings people, ideas, places, and initiatives together. Not from a single plan or fixed outcome, but from trust in what can emerge between them.</p>
  </div>
</section>

